planner/caller/summarizer, VLA robotics; limitations.\n\nMulti-agent summary: CAMEL inception prompting, role play, Generative Agents 100 evaluators, AgentSociety, AgentVerse; limitations emergent eval.\n\nOutlook summary Table 4 five topics and two foundations reasoning/retrieval.\n\nApplication: distinguish implemented features, gaps, future. We need know our agent. Likely implemented command tool, PDF batch reading, persistent notes, model request logs, report validation. We can phrase generally and cautiously: \"已实现...\" likely true: command tool calling read_pdf.py, batch page reading, note persistence, report JSON generation, request logs. \"不足\" no automated evidence verification, limited context management. \"未来\" multi-agent/training are suggestions. Ensure don't claim multi-agent implemented. They specifically note \"Multi-agent collaboration and training are future suggestions, not implemented features.\" So application can say \"未来可尝试...\" for multi-agent, not implemented.\n\nWe need save_section signature section, summary, application. Then submit_report overview, expected_hash. Save_section might produce saved result. Use one block. Let's do."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8835,"completion_tokens":2101,"total_tokens":10936,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4352},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1066},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4352,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4483},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}